"voice": "<k>voice_preset</k>: <v>'cornerman'</v>  (warmth <v>5</v> · humor <v>3</v> · directness <v>3</v> · energy <v>4</v>)\n<k>stance_school</k>: <v>polarized</v>\n<k>emphasis</k>: Data↔Sentiment <v>3</v> (balanced) · Process↔Outcome <v>1</v> (strongly Process)\n<k>corpus.school.stance</k>: \"Durability is built by lots of easy aerobic running; the long game beats any single sharp session.\"",
"llmcall": "<k>prompt_id</k>: <v>coach_message_v6</v> · <k>schema</k>: <v>2.0</v>\n<k>message</k>: \"Dear Reader, this author is pleased — if not exactly dazzled — to report that your evening ride was everything it should have been: unremarkable in the very best way. Thirty-one minutes on the indoor bicycle, heart rate averaging 140 against your confirmed maximum of 191, effort firmly in the easy range. No GPS to interrogate, no cadence to nitpick, risk score an immaculate zero. It was, in its proper context, the tidy denouement to an evening's broader block — a walk and a run before it, the combined effort totalling some 86 minutes of movement. The ride knew its station and kept to it admirably. More pressingly: you kept it easy. This author does maintain a ledger. That ledger records that roughly five of every eight easy-brief moments have been honoured, and today is evidently among the five — which now makes it six, duly noted without excessive ceremony. There is one matter this column will not leave unexamined before signing off: your efficiency on comparable easy, flat efforts has declined by approximately 15% across the last four sessions. Four sessions is a slim dossier and no great scandal shall be declared upon such evidence — but it is a whisper worth watching. The remedy is not cleverness or sudden exertion; it is exactly what you did this evening, repeated with patience. Aerobic durability is assembled in the quiet repetitions. The dramatic ones rarely do the lasting work. The standing brief remains unchanged: next session at a genuinely conversational easy pace, RPE 2 to 3, start to finish — and a gradual nudge to cadence across the coming runs, incrementally, never forced. *With faithful precision,* *This Author*\"",
"contract": "<k>tail.headline</k>: \"Easy indoor ride — easy-discipline compliance, efficiency trend to watch\"\n<k>tail.next_steps[0].action</k>: \"Keep next session at genuinely easy effort\"\n<k>.next_steps</k>: <v>2 step(s)</v>",
