"fallback": "<v>Not triggered</v> — generation + parse + policy all succeeded.",
"coachreport": "<k>key</k>: (activity_id, <v>coach_message_v6</v>, <v>2.0</v>)\n<k>report</k>: prose message + structured tail stored (display-safe read)\n\n<k>digest</k> (the stored exchange digest read by later reports) =\n<v>{\n  \"activity_date\": \"2026-06-16T17:00:59+00:00\",\n  \"headline\": \"Moderate when easy was the brief — HR stability and efficiency trend genuinely excellent\",\n  \"lead_argument\": \"Yesterday the instruction was keep it genuinely easy.\",\n  \"next_steps\": [\n    \"Run the next session at genuinely easy effort (Conversational pace, RPE 2-3, start to finish — no moderate drift)\",\n    \"Nudge cadence toward 170+ over coming sessions (Gradually, not forced — current cadence of 159 is meaningfully below target; aim to creep upward across the next few runs)\"\n  ]\n}</v>",
"writeback": "<v>DISABLED</v> — COACH_BELIEFS_ENABLED off (PR #403).\nNo belief deltas are written after a report.\nStored rows untouched, so a recalibrated re-enable resumes from history.",
